# Built installers, each version in a folder of its own (release/README.md). The command-line
# edition (its sgbus file and .deb, cli/build.mjs) and the README on publishing them are
# committed. The APKs up to 2.4.0 are too, as they already were: from 2.4.1, at around 100 MB,
# GitHub's limit for a file, they go only on the GitHub release, as the desktop installers do.
# Anything else isn't kept either.
release/**
!release/*/
!release/README.md
!release/*/sgbus
!release/*/sg-bus-timings-cli-*.deb


# Agent worktrees (help desk and workspace boards).
.claude/worktrees/
